{"id":"en-sentences-beginner","kind":"sentence","title":"회화 필수 문장 · 초급","description":"10가지 상황에서 바로 쓰는 문장 100개 (한 → 영)","lang":"en-US","version":1,"source":"되새김 자체 제작","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","items":[{"id":"s-greet-01","situation":"인사·안부","ko":"오랜만이에요!","en":"It's been a while!","key":"It's been a while"},{"id":"s-greet-02","situation":"인사·안부","ko":"그동안 어떻게 지냈어요?","en":"How have you been?","key":"How have you been","note":"오랜만에 만난 사람에게"},{"id":"s-greet-03","situation":"인사·안부","ko":"별일 없어요, 늘 똑같죠.","en":"Not much. Same as usual.","key":"Same as usual"},{"id":"s-greet-04","situation":"인사·안부","ko":"만나서 반가워요.","en":"It's nice to meet you.","key":"nice to meet you","note":"처음 만났을 때"},{"id":"s-greet-05","situation":"인사·안부","ko":"주말 잘 보냈어요?","en":"Did you have a good weekend?","key":"have a good weekend"},{"id":"s-greet-06","situation":"인사·안부","ko":"괜찮아요? 안색이 안 좋아 보여요.","en":"Is everything okay? You look a little pale.","key":"Is everything okay"},{"id":"s-greet-07","situation":"인사·안부","ko":"가족들은 잘 지내죠?","en":"How's your family doing?","key":"How's your family doing"},{"id":"s-greet-08","situation":"인사·안부","ko":"이제 가 봐야겠어요.","en":"I should get going.","key":"get going"},{"id":"s-greet-09","situation":"인사·안부","ko":"얘기 즐거웠어요.","en":"It was nice talking to you.","key":"nice talking to you","note":"헤어질 때"},{"id":"s-greet-10","situation":"인사·안부","ko":"조심히 가요.","en":"Take care.","key":"Take care"},{"id":"s-intro-01","situation":"자기소개","ko":"저는 서울에서 왔어요.","en":"I'm from Seoul.","key":"I'm from"},{"id":"s-intro-02","situation":"자기소개","ko":"저는 IT 회사에서 일해요.","en":"I work for an IT company.","key":"work for","note":"work for + 회사"},{"id":"s-intro-03","situation":"자기소개","ko":"마케팅 일을 해요.","en":"I work in marketing.","key":"work in","note":"work in + 분야"},{"id":"s-intro-04","situation":"자기소개","ko":"쉬는 날엔 주로 영화를 봐요.","en":"I usually watch movies on my days off.","key":"on my days off"},{"id":"s-intro-05","situation":"자기소개","ko":"영어 공부한 지 1년 됐어요.","en":"I've been studying English for a 