:"쇼핑","ko":"이거 다른 색도 있어요?","en":"Do you have this in another color?","key":"in another color"},{"id":"s-shop-03","situation":"쇼핑","ko":"이거 입어 봐도 돼요?","en":"Can I try this on?","key":"try this on"},{"id":"s-shop-04","situation":"쇼핑","ko":"더 큰 사이즈 있어요?","en":"Is there a larger size?","key":"larger size"},{"id":"s-shop-05","situation":"쇼핑","ko":"이거 얼마예요?","en":"How much is this?","key":"How much is"},{"id":"s-shop-06","situation":"쇼핑","ko":"좀 깎아 주실 수 있어요?","en":"Can you give me a discount?","key":"give me a discount"},{"id":"s-shop-07","situation":"쇼핑","ko":"카드 돼요?","en":"Do you take cards?","key":"Do you take"},{"id":"s-shop-08","situation":"쇼핑","ko":"좀 더 생각해 볼게요.","en":"I'll think about it.","key":"think about it","note":"사지 않고 나올 때"},{"id":"s-shop-09","situation":"쇼핑","ko":"이거 환불되나요?","en":"Can I get a refund for this?","key":"get a refund"},{"id":"s-shop-10","situation":"쇼핑","ko":"선물 포장해 주실 수 있어요?","en":"Could you gift-wrap it?","key":"gift-wrap"},{"id":"s-way-01","situation":"길 묻기·교통","ko":"실례지만, 역이 어디예요?","en":"Excuse me, where's the station?","key":"Excuse me"},{"id":"s-way-02","situation":"길 묻기·교통","ko":"걸어갈 수 있는 거리예요?","en":"Is it within walking distance?","key":"walking distance"},{"id":"s-way-03","situation":"길 묻기·교통","ko":"거기까지 얼마나 걸려요?","en":"How long does it take to get there?","key":"How long does it take"},{"id":"s-way-04","situation":"길 묻기·교통","ko":"이 버스 시청 가요?","en":"Does this bus go to City Hall?","key":"Does this bus go to"},{"id":"s-way-05","situation":"길 묻기·교통","ko":"어디서 갈아타야 해요?","en":"Where do I transfer?","key":"transfer"},{"id":"s-way-06","situation":"길 묻기·교통","ko":"길을 잃은 것 같아요.","en":"I think I'm lost.","key":"I'm lost"},{"id":"s-way-07","situation":"길 묻기·교통","ko":"지도에서 좀 보여 주실래요?","en":"Can you show me on the map?","key":"show me on the map"},{"id":"s-way-08","situation":"길 묻기·교통","ko":"쭉 가다가 오른쪽으로 도세요.","en":"Go straight and turn right.","key":"Go straight"},{"id":"s-way-09","situation":"길 묻기·교통","ko":"이 주소로 가 주세요.","en":"Please take me to 