-06","situation":"약속·일정","ko":"다른 날로 바꿀 수 있을까요?","en":"Can we reschedule?","key":"reschedule"},{"id":"s-plan-07","situation":"약속·일정","ko":"10분 정도 늦을 것 같아요.","en":"I'm running about ten minutes late.","key":"running"},{"id":"s-plan-08","situation":"약속·일정","ko":"도착하면 문자할게요.","en":"I'll text you when I get there.","key":"when I get there"},{"id":"s-plan-09","situation":"약속·일정","ko":"거의 다 왔어요.","en":"I'm almost there.","key":"almost there"},{"id":"s-plan-10","situation":"약속·일정","ko":"기다리게 해서 미안해요.","en":"Sorry to keep you waiting.","key":"keep you waiting"},{"id":"s-polite-01","situation":"부탁·감사·사과","ko":"부탁 하나 해도 될까요?","en":"Can I ask you a favor?","key":"ask you a favor"},{"id":"s-polite-02","situation":"부탁·감사·사과","ko":"사진 좀 찍어 주실 수 있어요?","en":"Could you take a picture of us?","key":"Could you"},{"id":"s-polite-03","situation":"부탁·감사·사과","ko":"좀 도와줄래요?","en":"Could you give me a hand?","key":"give me a hand"},{"id":"s-polite-04","situation":"부탁·감사·사과","ko":"좀 천천히 말해 주시겠어요?","en":"Could you speak more slowly?","key":"more slowly"},{"id":"s-polite-05","situation":"부탁·감사·사과","ko":"죄송한데, 다시 한 번 말해 주시겠어요?","en":"Sorry, could you say that again?","key":"say that again"},{"id":"s-polite-06","situation":"부탁·감사·사과","ko":"정말 고마워요, 덕분에 살았어요.","en":"Thanks a lot. You're a lifesaver.","key":"lifesaver"},{"id":"s-polite-07","situation":"부탁·감사·사과","ko":"별말씀을요.","en":"Don't mention it.","key":"Don't mention it","note":"고맙다는 말에 대한 대답"},{"id":"s-polite-08","situation":"부탁·감사·사과","ko":"늦어서 죄송해요.","en":"Sorry I'm late.","key":"Sorry I'm late"},{"id":"s-polite-09","situation":"부탁·감사·사과","ko":"제 잘못이에요.","en":"That's my fault.","key":"my fault"},{"id":"s-polite-10","situation":"부탁·감사·사과","ko":"괜찮아요, 신경 쓰지 마세요.","en":"It's okay. Don't worry about it.","key":"Don't worry about it","note":"사과를 받았을 때"},{"id":"s-feel-01","situation":"감정·의견","ko":"좋은 생각인 것 같아요.","en":"I think it's a good idea.","key":"I think"},{"id":"s-feel-02","situation":"감정·의견","ko":"저도 그렇게 생각해요.","en":"I think so, too.","key":"I think so, too"},{"id":"s-feel-03","situation":"감정·의견","ko":"잘 모르겠어요.","en":"I'm not sure.","key":"not sure"},{"id":"s-feel-04","situation":"감정·의견","ko":"그건 좋은 생각이 아닌 것 같아요.","en":"I don't think that's a good idea.","key":"I don't think","note":"반대 의견을 부드럽게"},{"id":"s-feel-05","situation":"감정·의견","ko":"잘됐네요!","en":"Good for you!","key":"Good for you","note":"좋은 소식을 들었을 때"},{"id":"s-feel-06","situation":"감정·의견","ko":"그 말 들으니 마음이 안 좋네요.","en":"I'm sorry to hear that.","key":"sorry to hear that","note":"안 좋은 소식을 들었을 때"},{"id":"s-feel-07","situation":"감정·의견","ko":"그럴 줄 알았어요.","en":"I knew it.","key":"I knew it"},{"id":"s-feel-08","situation":"감정·의견","ko":"무슨 말인지 알아요.","en":"I know what you mean.","key":"know what you mean"},{"id":"s-feel-09","situation":"감정·의견","ko":"너무 기대돼요.","en":"I can't wait.","key":"I can't wait"},{"id":"s-feel-10","situation":"감정·의견","ko":"상관없어요. 둘 다 좋아요.","en":"I don't mind. Either is fine.","key":"I don't mind"},{"id":"s-phone-01","situation":"전화·문자","ko":"민수 씨와 통화할 수 있을까요?","en":"May I speak to Minsu?","key":"May I speak to"},{"id":"s-phone-02","situation":"전화·문자","ko":"누구시라고 전해 드릴까요?","en":"May I ask who's calling?","key":"who's calling"},{"id":"s-phone-03","situation":"전화·문자","ko":"잠시만 기다려 주세요.","en":"Please hold on a moment.","key":"hold on"},{"id":"s-phone-04","situation":"전화·문자","ko":"지금 통화 괜찮아요?","en":"Is this a good time to talk?","key":"a good time to talk"},{"id":"s-phone-05","situation":"전화·문자","ko":"잘 안 들려요.","en":"I can't hear you very well.","key":"can't hear you"},{"id":"s-phone-06","situation":"전화·문자","ko":"전화가 끊겼어요.","en":"We got cut off.","key":"got cut off"},{"id":"s-phone-07","situation":"전화·문자","ko":"이따 다시 전화할게요.","en":"I'll call you back later.","key":"call you back"},{"id":"s-phone-08","situation":"전화·문자","ko":"메시지 남겨 드릴까요?","en":"Can I take a message?","key":"take a message"},{"id":"s-phone-09","situation":"전화·문자","ko":"답장이 늦어서 미안해요.","en":"Sorry for the late reply.","key":"late reply"},{"id":"s-phone-10","situation":"전화·문자","ko":"끝나면 문자 줘요.","en":"Text me when you're done.","key":"Text me"}]}